	"adaptations": [
		"Svelte snippets and reactive state replace React JSX/hooks; useDirection returns a reactive current getter.",
		"LayerChart replaces Recharts with the same chart data, labels, grouped series and RTL ordering.",
		"Bits Calendar and Intl replace DayPicker/date-fns, preserving locale and date-selection behavior.",
		"Combobox chips use Bits Combobox plus Badge/removal buttons because Bits has no chips primitives; chip arrow navigation is not added.",
		"Paneforge v1 reads document.dir for resize direction; local preview direction alone cannot guarantee inverted resize deltas.",
		"No Svelte create --rtl or migrate rtl command exists; framework and migration instructions describe supported initialization/manual changes.",
		"Bits UI floating sides remain physical. ContextMenu.Content, ContextMenu.SubContent and DropdownMenu.SubContent adapt inline-start/inline-end reactively and preserve explicit physical sides; primitive submenu defaults (#2306) are separate. Menubar submenus still need a direction-aware physical side.",
		"Shimmer retains upstream static bilingual LTR/RTL comparison; it has no translation dictionary or language selector upstream."
	]
